<title>USA: Cantel says Rumble becomes unit's CEO.</title>
<headline>Cantel says Rumble becomes unit's CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CLIFTON, N.J. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cantel Industries Inc said on Tuesday that R.M. Rumble has assumed the position of President and Chief Executive Officer of MediVators Inc, Cantel's wholly owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>Rumble was formerly the Manager of the Sterilization Assurance Business Unit of Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co's Medical Surgical Markets Division.</p>
<p>Cantel makes endoscope disinfection equipment and supplies and medical waste disposal systems.</p>
</text>
